BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:paradigm-20260828@hermes-tools
DTSTAMP:20260827T192516Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260828
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260829
SUMMARY:4h 28m - Movement Capacity Builder\, Push Supplementals
DESCRIPTION:Movement Capacity Builder - 3h 13m\n  Coach: Avoid doing every 
 climb with the same grip type. For example: If the first few problems use 
 crimps\, choose problems that involve slopers or pinches next. Repeating t
 he same grip repeatedly can overload small finger joints even at moderate 
 intensity. Spread the stress across different grips. Your fingers will tha
 nk you later.\n  Warm-up (1h 10m)\n    Finger Base Warm-Up - 15m\n    Step
  1: Dynamic Stretching - 15m\n    Muscular Activation - 20m\n    Hang Warm
 -Up - 10m\n    Twisting + Opening the Hips - 15m\n    Toe Placements - 15m
 \n    Deadpoint Focused - 15m\n    Flagging Perfection - 15m\n    Directio
 nal Holds and Body Positioning - 15m\n    Drop-Knees and Perching - 15m\n 
    High-Step + Through-Step - 15m\n    Foot Switching - 15m\n    Heel Hook
 s and Toe Grabbing - 15m\n  Workout (2h 3m) - choose from group A\n    Cap
 acity Phase Warning! - 3m\n    [A] Tension Activation - 30m\n    [A] Max V
 elocity Deadpoints - 30m\n    Strength Building Blocks (Capacity) - 1h 30m
 \n\nPush Supplementals - 1h 15m\n  Warm-up (15m)\n    Step 1: Dynamic Stre
 tching - 15m\n  Workout (1h) - choose from group A\n    Bench Press - 1 - 
 2 sets x 12 reps @ 5-6 RPE\n    Overhead Press - 1 - 2 sets x 12 reps @ 6 
 RPE\n    Lateral Raise - 1 - 2 sets x 12 reps @ 6 RPE\n    [A] Tricep Exte
 nsions - 1 - 2 sets x 12 reps @ 6 RPE\n    [A] Dips - 1 - 2 sets x 12 reps
  @ 5-6 RPE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:paradigm-20260829@hermes-tools
DTSTAMP:20260827T192516Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260829
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260830
SUMMARY:1h 10m - Capacity Phase Mobility Development Day
DESCRIPTION:Capacity Phase Mobility Development Day - 1h 10m\n  Warm-up (10
 m)\n    Mobility Warm-Up - 10m\n  Workout (55m)\n    Horse Stance Slides -
  1 sets x 8 reps\n    Taylors Pose - 3 sets x 8 reps\n    Drop-Stance Squa
 ts - 2 sets x 8 reps per side\n    Isometric Side Split - 2 sets x 1 reps\
 n    Cable Pull-In - 3 sets x 8 reps\n    Step Ups - 3 sets x 6 reps
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:paradigm-20260830@hermes-tools
DTSTAMP:20260827T192516Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260830
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260831
SUMMARY:4h 35m - Skill Practice + Density Hangs\, Pull Supplementals
DESCRIPTION:Skill Practice + Density Hangs - 3h 20m\n  Coach: This is a big
  one. Because you are already loading the fingers with Density Hangs\, you
  need to be smart about grip overlap in the climbing and pull work around 
 it.\n\nA few rules:\n	•	Your density hangs are on an edge\, avoid making
  the rest of the session heavily edge-dominant.\n	•	If the skill drill o
 r free climbing is already crimp-heavy\, choose a more open-hand or varied
  grip for the hangs if possible.\n	•	Avoid stacking repeated half crimp 
 stress across the entire day.\n	•	If fingers feel stiff\, puffy\, or irr
 itated during the hangs\, reduce the intensity immediately or skip them.\n
 \nThe goal is distributed stress\, not hammering the exact same tissues ov
 er and over.\n\nThink:\n	•	edges + slopers\n	•	open hand + pinch\n	•
 	varied movement + submax hang loading\n\nThat is how you build finger cap
 acity without accidentally turning a capacity day into the beginning of a 
 finger issue.\n  Warm-up (1h 10m)\n    Finger Base Warm-Up - 15m\n    Step
  1: Dynamic Stretching - 15m\n    Muscular Activation - 20m\n    Hang Warm
 -Up - 10m\n    Twisting + Opening the Hips - 15m\n    Toe Placements - 15m
 \n    Deadpoint Focused - 15m\n    Flagging Perfection - 15m\n    Directio
 nal Holds and Body Positioning - 15m\n    Drop-Knees and Perching - 15m\n 
    High-Step + Through-Step - 15m\n    Foot Switching - 15m\n    Heel Hook
 s and Toe Grabbing - 15m\n  Workout (2h 10m) - choose from group A\, B\n  
   [B] Tension Trainers - 40m\n    [B] Cross Trainers - 40m\n    [B] Heel T
 rainers - 40m\n    [B] Twist Trainers - 40m\n    [A] Density Hangs - 1h\n 
    [A] Free Climbing - 1h 30m\n\nPull Supplementals - 1h 15m\n  Warm-up (1
 5m)\n    Step 1: Dynamic Stretching - 15m\n  Workout (1h) - choose from gr
 oup A\, B\, C\n    [A] 1-arm lock-off 90 degrees - 1 - 2 sets x 1 reps @ 5
  FAIL\n    [A] 2-Arm Lock-Off 90 degrees - 1 - 2 sets x 1 reps @ 5 FAIL\n 
    [B] 1-Arm Lock-Off 120 degrees - 1 - 2 sets x 1 reps @ 5 FAIL\n    [B] 
 2-Arm Lock-Off 120 degrees - 1 - 2 sets x 1 reps @ 5 FAIL\n    [C] Dumbbel
 l Row - 1 - 2 sets x 12 reps @ 6 RPE\n    [C] High Bar/Ring Rows - 1 - 2 s
 ets x 12 reps @ 6 RPE\n    Wide Grip Pull-Ups - 1 - 2 sets x 6 reps @ 8 RP
 E
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
