SUMMARY:4h 28m - Ideal Circuit\, Legs/Core Supplementals
DESCRIPTION:Ideal Circuit - 3h 13m\n  Coach: Grip Overlap Warning: Pay atte
 ntion to repeated small crimps. If several attempts involve the same edge 
 size\, switch to a problem with a different grip style. Your finger joints
  are still building capacity in this phase.\n  Warm-up (1h 10m)\n    Finge
 r Base Warm-Up - 15m\n    Step 1: Dynamic Stretching - 15m\n    Muscular A
 ctivation - 20m\n    Hang Warm-Up - 10m\n    Twisting + Opening the Hips -
  15m\n    Toe Placements - 15m\n    Deadpoint Focused - 15m\n    Flagging 
 Perfection - 15m\n    Directional Holds and Body Positioning - 15m\n    Dr
 op-Knees and Perching - 15m\n    High-Step + Through-Step - 15m\n    Foot 
 Switching - 15m\n    Heel Hooks and Toe Grabbing - 15m\n  Workout (2h 3m) 
 - choose from group A\n    Capacity Phase Warning! - 3m\n    [A] Dynos - 3
 0m\n    [A] Hover Drill - 30m @ 7 RPE\n    [A] Slab Up-Down Repeats - 30m\
 n    Ideal Circuit - 1h 30m\n\nLegs/Core Supplementals - 1h 15m\n  Warm-up
  (15m)\n    Step 1: Dynamic Stretching - 15m\n  Workout (55m)\n    Single 
 Leg Romanian Deadlift - 1 - 2 sets x 12 reps @ 5-6 RPE\n    Heel-Hook Isom
 etric Pull  60\, 90\, 120 Degrees - 1 - 3 sets x 30s @ 7-8 RPE\n    TRX/Ri
 ngs Body Saws - 1 - 2 sets x 12 reps @ 6 RPE\n    Bulgarian Split Squats -
  1 - 2 sets x 12 reps @ 6 RPE
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
