SUMMARY:4h 28m - Movement Capacity Builder\, Push Supplementals
DESCRIPTION:Movement Capacity Builder - 3h 13m\n  Coach: Avoid doing every 
 climb with the same grip type. For example: If the first few problems use 
 crimps\, choose problems that involve slopers or pinches next. Repeating t
 he same grip repeatedly can overload small finger joints even at moderate 
 intensity. Spread the stress across different grips. Your fingers will tha
 nk you later.\n  Workout (2h 3m) - choose from group A\n    Capacity Phase
  Warning! - 3m\n    [A] Tension Activation - 30m\n    [A] Max Velocity Dea
 dpoints - 30m\n    Strength Building Blocks (Capacity) - 1h 30m\n\nPush Su
 pplementals - 1h 15m\n  Workout (1h) - choose from group A\n    Bench Pres
 s - 1 - 2 sets x 10 reps @ 5-6 RPE\n    Overhead Press - 1 - 2 sets x 10 r
 eps @ 5-6 RPE\n    Lateral Raise - 1 - 2 sets x 10 reps @ 5-6 RPE\n    [A]
  Tricep Extensions - 1 - 2 sets x 10 reps @ 5-6 RPE\n    [A] Dips - 1 - 2 
 sets x 10 reps @ 5-6 RPE\n\n(Warm-up detail not synced for this day.)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
