SUMMARY:1h 10m - Capacity Phase Mobility Development Day
DESCRIPTION:Capacity Phase Mobility Development Day - 1h 10m\n  Workout (1h
 )\n    Horse Stance Slides - 1 sets x 8 reps\n    Taylors Pose - 3 sets x 
 8 reps\n    Drop-Stance Squats - 2 sets x 8 reps per side\n    Isometric S
 ide Split - 1 sets x 1 reps\n    Cable Pull-In - 3 sets x 8 reps\n    Step
  Ups - 3 sets x 7 reps\n\n(Warm-up detail not synced for this day.)
